    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TO_0000250 -->

    <Class rdf:about="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TO_0000250">
        <rdfs:label>plant vigor trait</rdfs:label>
        <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TO_0000387"/>
        <rdfs:comment>Plants vigor traits include those of a whole plant (PO:00009011; inclucluding a seedling), or parts of the plant such as a seed (PO:0009010), or of explants such as anthers (PO:0009066) or cuttings.</rdfs:comment>
        <oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>plant_trait_ontology</oboInOwl:hasOBONamespace>
        <oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>plant vigour trait (exact)</oboInOwl:hasExactSynonym>
        <oboInOwl:id>TO:0000250</oboInOwl:id>
        <ns3:IAO_0000115>A plant trait (TO:0000387) which is a measure of the active and/or healthy growth and development of a plant stucture (PO:0009011) or a population of plants.</ns3:IAO_0000115>
    </Class>
    


    <!-- http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/TO_0000387 -->

